# UrbanPulse AI — Implementation Plan (Revised)

A production-quality, AI-powered Urban Infrastructure Intelligence platform aligned with UN SDG 11.  
**Backend: Python Flask + SQLite | Frontend: Jinja2 + Vanilla CSS/JS**

## Architecture Overview

**Backend**: Python Flask + SQLite (SQLAlchemy ORM)  
**Auth**: Flask-Login + Werkzeug password hashing  
**Templates**: Jinja2 with template inheritance  
**Frontend**: Vanilla CSS3 + JavaScript (ES6)  
**Maps**: Leaflet.js (CDN) | **Charts**: Chart.js (CDN) | **Icons**: Lucide (CDN)  
**Design**: Premium gov-tech aesthetic, glassmorphism, dark/light mode

```mermaid
