## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python seed_data.py
python run.py
```

### Manual Verification
1. Launch app at `http://localhost:5000`
2. Login with all 4 demo accounts and verify correct routing
3. Submit a citizen complaint and track through full lifecycle
4. Admin: manage complaints, run Digital Twin simulation, view risk engine
5. Test AI Decision Support queries
6. NGO: create initiative, request volunteers
7. Volunteer: browse opportunities, apply, track activities
8. Test SOS trigger and trusted contacts
9. Toggle dark/light mode on all pages
10. Test responsive layout (mobile, tablet, desktop)
11. Verify route protection (try accessing admin routes as citizen)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Scale**: This is a ~70+ file Python Flask application with 20+ database tables and a full premium frontend. I will build it systematically following the build order above. Each module is connected through the SQLite database and Flask's template inheritance.

> [!NOTE]
> **Dependencies**: Only standard Python packages (Flask ecosystem). Maps and charts use CDN-loaded libraries. No Node.js or npm required. Just `pip install` and `python run.py`.
